evidence_notes = "B7 securely links a wide pale delta/arrow craft to the Zenith-class Interceptor label in footage uploaded in 2012. The exact B7-observed geometry scope is frames 373-467; recording date and build revision are unknown. A5 says Interceptor while A9 says Fighter, so the dated role conflict remains explicit. The implemented single-pilot cockpit, dimensions, access, canopy, propulsion, weapons, collision, audio, damage, docking, materials and every numeric flight value are modern gameplay design. No historical handling claim is made."
